WEBVTT

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:30.180
Yeah.

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:18.520
The legacy of the metal, when man fought machine and machine won.

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:24.150
Five hundred monstrous creations that hunt down human survivors.

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:25.630
Digitized.

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:29.980
Kini sent.

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:34.470
Bio-Dread Empire, stronghold and fortress of Lord Dread.

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:39.510
From the fires of the Metal Wars arose a new breed of warriors.

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:41.630
They were soldiers of the future.
